title: Canvas Puzzle (Ghost Ritual)
story: dungeo
description: Burn incense in Basin Room, pray to bless water, drop frame piece to complete ghost ritual. Canvas spawns in Gallery. Restores from wt-15.
---

# Restore state from wt-15 (player at Living Room with lantern)
# Living Room floor has: incense, frame piece, and other items
$restore wt-15

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Pick up ritual items from Living Room
# ============================================================================

[GOAL: Pick up incense and frame piece]

> take incense

> take frame piece

> inventory

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Navigate to Basin Room
# Route: Living Room → Cellar → Troll Room → E/W Passage → Deep Ravine
#        → Chasm → N/S Passage → Loud Room → Ancient Chasm → Basin Room
# ============================================================================

[GOAL: Navigate to Basin Room]

> open trap door

# The torch was lost to the glacier in wt-15 — the lantern is our only light.
> turn on lantern

> down

> east

> north

> north

> east

> east

> northeast

> east

> south

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Burn incense to disarm the basin trap
# ============================================================================

[GOAL: Burn incense to disarm basin]

> burn incense

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Pray to bless the water
# ============================================================================

[GOAL: Pray to bless water]

> pray

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Drop frame piece in basin to complete ghost ritual
# ============================================================================

[GOAL: Complete ghost ritual]

> drop frame piece

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Go to Gallery and take the canvas
# ============================================================================

[GOAL: Get canvas from Gallery]

# Navigate to Gallery (Basin Room → Ancient Chasm → Loud Room → N/S Passage →
# Chasm → Deep Ravine → E/W Passage → Troll Room → N/S Crawlway → Studio → Gallery)
> north

> west

> west

> north

> south

> south

> west

> east

> south

> northwest

> look

> take canvas

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Store canvas in trophy case
# ============================================================================

[GOAL: Store canvas in trophy case]

# Return to Living Room (Gallery → Studio → N/S Crawlway → Troll Room → Cellar → Living Room)
> south

> north

> east

> west

> up

> open trophy case

> put canvas in trophy case

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Verify final score
# ============================================================================

[GOAL: Verify score]

> score

> gdt
> ds ledger
> ex

# Bank lantern battery in the lit Living Room; wt-17 turns it back on.
> turn off lantern

[END GOAL]

$save wt-16
